WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:04.800
So 30 seconds, a rewired, inspired future
without limits looks like what?

00:05.000 --> 00:10.300
Today I choose, and this is what you're gonna carry
for yourself all day [unclear].

00:10.600 --> 00:15.100
Today I choose what?
It might be freedom. I choose freedom.

00:15.800 --> 00:20.900
Today I choose peace. Today I choose success.
Today I choose being a winner.

00:21.100 --> 00:25.600
Today I choose me.
Today I choose me.

00:26.900 --> 00:30.800
I know, right?
Today, choose you.

00:31.400 --> 00:35.700
The way you are and the way you are not.
Choose you.

00:37.100 --> 00:40.600
The way you came into the door today or not,
choose you.
